			.faq__title.title faq
			.faq__wrapper
				details.drop-menu
					summary.drop-btn
						div How do you earn money with the affiliate program?
						span
					.drop__wrap
						.drop__text Sign up, choose CPA or RevShare, and start driving traffic to available offers.
				details.drop-menu
					summary.drop-btn
						div Need help or have a question?
						span
					.drop__wrap
						.drop__text Our support team is available 24/7. You can contact us via live chat or reach out directly to your personal manager on Telegram.
				details.drop-menu
					summary.drop-btn
						div How often are payouts made?
						span
					.drop__wrap
						.drop__text Payouts are processed weekly or twice a month (during the 1st–10th and 15th–25th of each month).
				details.drop-menu
					summary.drop-btn
						div Which model should you choose — CPA or RevShare?
						span
					.drop__wrap
						.drop__list
							li CPA — ideal for quick results
							li RevShare — ideal for stable, long-term revenue
				details.drop-menu
					summary.drop-btn
						div Which GEOs are accepted?
						span
					.drop__wrap
						.drop__text The list of supported GEOs is regularly updated. Please check the latest available markets with your manager.
				details.drop-menu
					summary.drop-btn
						div Are there any traffic restrictions?
						span
					.drop__wrap
						.drop__title The following are strictly prohibited:
						.drop__list
							li fraud and incentivized traffic;
							li spam and deceptive practices;
							li underage audiences (under 18);
							li political or religious content in creatives.
				details.drop-menu
					summary.drop-btn
						div How to get started?
						span
					.drop__wrap
						.drop__text Sign up for the affiliate program, select offers and GEOs, and start promoting in the iGaming niche.
